        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF152 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">options.pseudoElement</code> param to be passed to <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/getAnimations#options\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Element.getAnimations()</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1935557\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1935557</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds the subfeature. Tested <a href=\"https://wpt.live/web-animations/interfaces/Animatable/getAnimations-pseudoElement-option-on-view-transition.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.live/web-animations/interfaces/Animatable/getAnimations-pseudoElement-option-on-view-transition.html</a> as not working on current Safari (17) and Chrome.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note, not caught be collector run by <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4489445631\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29718\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29718/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29718\">#29718</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4469273324\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44160\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44160/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44160\">mdn/content#44160</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29728",
            "title": "FF152 Element.getAnimations() accepts options.pseudoElement",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-22T04:58:35.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-22T04:58:03.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF152 supports <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCEncodedAudioFrame.receiveTime</code> ,  <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCEncodedVideoFrame.receiveTime</code>  and the <code class=\"notranslate\">receiveTime</code> property is now returned in the object that comes from their (respective) <code class=\"notranslate\">getMetadata()</code> methods in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2033420\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2033420</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the features to 152. Somehow missed in the collector run <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4489445631\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29718\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29718/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29718\">#29718</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4469276037\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44161\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44161/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44161\">mdn/content#44161</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29727",
            "title": "RTCEncodedAudio/VideoFrame.receiveTime and metadata",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-22T04:17:56.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-22T04:17:17.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF152 suports Notification.maxActions, Notification.action,  NotificationEvent.action in Ff152 in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1959931\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1959931</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Notification.action was updated in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4489445631\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29718\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29718/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29718\">#29718</a> - this updates the other two.<br>\nBCD collector seems to not run well for these - it gives me unknown on the event.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4469268704\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44159\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44159/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44159\">mdn/content#44159</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29726",
            "title": "Ff152 Notification.maxActions NotificationEvent.action",
