        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13602871?u=a8d413c51c9bdf1f7aed9729590112de4e414204&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates for compatibility table for Deno v2.8, but includes earlier versions too (inconsistencies caught during v2.8 updates)</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://deno.com/blog/v2.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deno.com/blog/v2.8</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/tag/v2.8.0\">https://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/tag/v2.8.0</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29724",
            "title": "Updates for Deno v2.8 and earlier",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-21T16:36:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-21T16:36:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "bartlomieju",
                "url": "https://github.com/bartlomieju"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As best as I can tell, Edge's variation on Google's protected audience API never shipped and was gated behind a flag. This will make removal dates make more sense.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See this blog post: <a href=\"https://blogs.windows.com/msedgedev/2024/03/05/new-privacy-preserving-ads-api/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://blogs.windows.com/msedgedev/2024/03/05/new-privacy-preserving-ads-api/</a> and the discussion on <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2845705770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2635\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635\">web-platform-dx/web-features#2635</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This was never quite the same as protected audience, but it shared some of the same surface area.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also, it's slated for removal (like Google's API); see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2845705770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2635\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635/hovercard?comment_id=3971985214&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635#issuecomment-3971985214\">web-platform-dx/web-features#2635 (comment)</a>.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2845705770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2635\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/2635\">web-platform-dx/web-features#2635</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29723",
            "title": "Edge's privacy preserving ads API never shipped",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-22T12:42:17.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-21T16:22:07.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
                "url": "https://github.com/ddbeck"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates the Safari support statement for <code class=\"notranslate\">ReadableStream.@@asyncIterator</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The feature did not ship in Safari 26.4 yet, see <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29708#issuecomment-4500514487\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29708/hovercard\">this comment</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29708.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4480275080\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29708\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29708/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29708\">#29708</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29714",
            "title": "Safari TP supports async iterable streams",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-20T16:45:39.000Z",
